  "operatingSystem": "Windows, macOS, Linux, Android",
  "description": "Free, open-source SSH and SFTP client for Windows, macOS, Linux and Android. Tabbed terminal, dual-pane SFTP browser, local/remote/dynamic port forwarding (SOCKS4/5, HTTP CONNECT), two-way folder mirror, server info, Docker and monitoring panels, and VNC, RDP and Telnet sessions, with encrypted profiles and optional cloud sync.",
